<title>POLAND: PBR Q3 net profit jumps to PLN 6.2 mln.</title>
<headline>PBR Q3 net profit jumps to PLN 6.2 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polski Bank Rozwoju SA results for the third quarter of 1996 ending September 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						 Q3 1996     Q3 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit			9.14   vs   9.37</p>
<p>    pre-tax				   9.14   vs   9.37</p>
<p>    net					 6.21   vs   3.84</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of the bank is Polski Bank Rozwoju SA. @</p>
<p>    profit on financial operations    2.59   vs   0.97</p>
<p>    revenues from securities	    0.07   vs   0.01</p>
<p>    revenues from commission	    2.12   vs   4.57</p>
<p>    interest and similar revenues    45.22   vs  36.57</p>
<p>    interest and similar costs	 28.39   vs  20.09</p>
<p>    costs of commission		   2.12   vs   4.57</p>
<p>    extraordinary			   0.00   vs   0.00</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
